{"4149710": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Crimora: Sun City", "steam_appid": 4149710, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4149710/extras/73762a93e8b3156f9802a282fce5b4c4.avif?t=1771855263\" width=1560 height=244 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Elvin, once a loyal member of Hector’s crew, now seeks to become both the hero <strong>and</strong> the villain of Sun City. Join him on this dangerous yet thrilling journey filled with power, loyalty, and chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the open world freely, turn up the radio, and feel the vibrant energy of Sun City!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4149710/extras/3863c4b6a4c27820381ff52007ebefeb.avif?t=1771855263\" width=1560 height=244 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Sun City</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Sun City, where crime, money, and power rule the streets. In this dazzling yet dangerous city, survival is everything. Explore buyable properties, build your empire, and rise to become the city’s new boss!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Radio Stations</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn up the vibe with a variety of radio stations! Whether it’s Hip-Hop, Pop, Lo-fi, or Jazz, cruise through the city to the rhythm of your favorite tunes.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Meet Elvin!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Born and raised in Sun City, Elvin has lived his life on the edge of crime. Join him on his journey — and who knows? You might just help him become the city’s next legend.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span cla